<section class="bg-purple-light text-white py-12 m:py-24 relative cursor-pointer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="m:absolute m:z-10 m:inset-0 m:flex m:flex-col m:justify-center m:items-center m:pointer-events-none">
      <h2 class="m:text-center m:mx-auto m:max-w-xl font-serif font-light text-3xl m:text-7xl leading-none uppercase mb-10 m:mb-0">
        Projets d'exceptions
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid m:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="col-span-5">
        {% include '@components/ui/card/card-project.twig' with {
          src: '/assets/projet1.jpg',
          alt: 'Un prohet Houlès',
          title: 'Hôtel 1 Place Vendôme - Paris, France',
          link: '/project-1',
          class: 'hidden m:flex',
          invert: false,
          width: 537,
          height: 763
        } %}
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-5 m:col-start-8 space-y-10">
        {% include '@components/ui/card/card-project.twig' with {
          src: '/assets/projet2.jpg',
          title: 'Hôtel 1 Place Vendôme - Paris, France',
          alt: 'Un prohet Houlès 2',
          link: '/project-1',
          class: '',
          width: 400,
          height: 400,
          invert: true
        } %}
        <p class="s:w-4/5">
          Architectes, décorateurs et tapissiers nous confient des projets résidentiels et
          prestigieux. Nos créations subliment des lieux d’exception tels que le Château de
          Versailles, le Palais d’Égmont ou l’Élysée. Découvrez quelques-unes de nos réalisations.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col m:flex-row items-center gap-6">
          {% include '@components/button.twig' with {
            label: 'Nous contacter',
            variant: 'solid',
            invert: true,
            attr: {
              type: 'submit'
            }
          } only %}
          {% include '@components/button.twig' with {
            label: 'Voir tous nos projets',
            variant: 'link',
            invert: true,
            attr: {
              type: 'submit'
            }
          } only %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
